#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Why did the eg arm still Read files after the payload gave it complete bodies?

For every eg session: compare the files the payload actually delivered (and whether it delivered a
COMPLETE body for them) against the files the agent then Read.

  REDUNDANT  - Read a file whose complete body was already in the payload  -> the prompt failed
  PARTIAL    - Read a file the payload mentioned but only as a locator     -> payload too thin
  ABSENT     - Read a file the payload never mentioned                     -> recall gap

Zero API cost. Usage: readwhy.py <tag/arm> [...]
"""
import json, glob, os, re, sys, collections

