<div><b>boilerplate queries</b><span>2/6 control winners have them and still win</span></div>
<div><b>hits out of score order</b><span>5/20 payloads, including two winners</span></div>
<div><b>missing COVERING TEST</b><span>inverted &mdash; 50% of losers vs 8% of winners</span></div>
<div><b>lint-only VERIFY</b><span>lint-only is the <em>best</em> class at &minus;24.6%</span></div>
<div><b>re-hunting payload text</b><span>base rate: baseline greps the same strings at 2.42/session vs eg's 2.42</span></div>
<div><b>provisioning episodes</b><span>package-install <em>decreases</em> in losers, 0.62&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;0.38</span></div>
<div><b>use the graph more</b><span>tripling usage measured worse; caddy &minus;56%&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;&minus;13%</span></div>
<div><b>index the tests</b><span>4,748 test symbols added, search output byte-identical</span></div>
<div><b>wider windows</b><span>+18.9pt worse</span></div>
<div><b>payload token tax</b><span>5.16% of winners vs 5.19% of losers &mdash; identical</span></div>
</div>

